r, it was first climbed in 1901."],"poi":"assiniboine"},{"t0":227.94,"dur":8.11,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":236.05,"dur":13.0,"zh":["左側遠方是班夫國家公園，加拿大的第一座國家公園。","1984 年，加拿大落磯山脈的國家公園群列入世界遺產。"],"en":["Far to the left: Banff National Park, Canada's first national park.","In 1984 the Canadian Rocky Mountain Parks joined the World Heritage List."],"poi":"banff"},{"t0":249.05,"dur":34.95,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":284.0,"dur":6.5,"zh":["降落卡加利國際機場。"],"en":["Landing at Calgary International Airport."]},{"t0":290.5,"dur":9.5,"zh":[],"en":[]}],"log":[{"t":0.0,"tt":0,"kind":"dep","zh":"起飛：溫哥華國際機場","en":"Takeoff: Vancouver International Airport"},{"t":44.79,"tt":635,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 79 公里：貝克山","en":"Mount Baker, 79 km right","k":"baker"},{"t":72.38,"tt":1039,"kind":"toc","zh":"爬升至巡航高度 35,000 呎","en":"Top of climb, 35,000 ft"},{"t":115.03,"tt":1653,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 21 公里：奧肯那根湖","en":"Okanagan Lake, 21 km right","k":"okanagan"},{"t":180.49,"tt":2630,"kind":"tod","zh":"開始下降","en":"Top of descent"},{"t":217.22,"tt":3145,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 3 公里：阿西尼博因山","en":"Mount Assiniboine, 3 km left","k":"assiniboine"},{"t":241.9,"tt":3241,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 35 公里：班夫","en":"Banff, 35 km left","k":"banff"},{"t":300.0,"tt":4200,"kind":"arr","zh":"降落：卡加利國際機場","en":"Landing: Calgary International Airport"}],"note":{"zh":"模擬畫面：航路取兩機場間的大圓航線，高度、速度與時間依一般客機爬升下降推算，並非實際航班紀錄；大部分雲層已移除。","en":"Simulation: a great-circle path between the airports, with height, speed and times estimated from typical airliner climbs and descents. Not a real flight record; most clouds are removed."},"geo_src":"great circle between the airports","sources":[{"title":"OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), route geometry","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Vancouver International Airport","url":"https://wikiwand.com/en/Vancouver_International_Airport"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Mount Baker","url":"https://wikiwand.com/en/articles/Mount_Baker"},{"title":"The Canadian Ency